WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:07.760
It's another busy day on the farm.

2
00:00:07.761 --> 00:00:14.047
Everyone has a job to do.

3
00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:21.131
Minnie: Whew! I swept the whole barn.

4
00:00:21.132 --> 00:00:30.270
Now I'll check on everyone else's work. Suki,

5
00:00:30.271 --> 00:00:37.771
Sally, Sara: We're watering the vegetables.

6
00:00:37.772 --> 00:00:47.482
Vincent: I'm pulling all the weeds.

7
00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:54.978
Elvin: I'm fixing the broken fence.

8
00:00:54.979 --> 00:00:58.611
Minnie: What are you doing, Gary?

9
00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:04.333
Gary: I'm busy too.

10
00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:06.796
Minnie: You are?

11
00:01:06.797 --> 00:01:21.056
Gary: Yes, I'm making sure everyone is working.

12
00:01:21.057 --> 00:01:24.436
Where are Jack and Polly? Minnie:

13
00:01:24.437 --> 00:01:33.172
They're laying new hay in the chicken coop. Gary:

14
00:01:33.173 --> 00:01:41.085
Polly isn't working! She's running over here.

15
00:01:41.086 --> 00:01:49.382
Minnie: Slow down, Polly.

16
00:01:49.383 --> 00:01:53.721
Polly: Can Jack and I go to the old barn?

17
00:01:53.722 --> 00:01:57.399
Minnie: Did you finish your job?

18
00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:02.638
Polly: Um . . . yes! We're all done.

19
00:02:02.639 --> 00:02:07.462
Minnie: Hmm. Then you may go.

20
00:02:07.463 --> 00:02:15.933
Polly: Yay!

21
00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:19.027
Jack: Polly, where did you go?

22
00:02:19.028 --> 00:02:20.738
Polly: I went to see Minnie.

23
00:02:20.739 --> 00:02:25.059
She said we can go to Omar's barn. Yay!

24
00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:33.296
Jack: But we didn't finish laying the hay.

25
00:02:33.297 --> 00:02:36.822
Polly: That's okay. We can do it later.

26
00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:44.875
Jack: Great! Let's go.

